ServeOverride.description:
A human decision that outranks the policy gate for one artefact. `block` always wins,
including over a passing policy; `allow` skips the policy check but never a manual block;
`null` clears the override and restores policy control.

value.rego:
package terramantle.policy

deny[msg] {
  input.findings[_].rule_id == "AVD-AWS-0107"
  msg := "security group open to the internet"
}
